7. Advantages of Computer

- Very fast
- Highly accurate
- Large storage capacity
- Saves time
- Easy communication
- Multitasking
- Reliable
- Automation

---

8. Disadvantages of Computer

- No intelligence of its own
- Depends on electricity
- Security risks
- Virus attacks
- Health problems from excessive use
- Job displacement due to automation

---

9. Limitations of Computer

- Cannot think like humans.
- Cannot make decisions without instructions.
- Has no emotions or feelings.
- Depends completely on programs.

---

10. Basic Parts of a Computer

Input Unit

Used to enter data.

Examples:

- Keyboard
- Mouse
- Scanner

CPU (Central Processing Unit)

Known as the brain of the computer.

It has three main parts:

- ALU (Arithmetic Logic Unit)
- CU (Control Unit)
- Registers

Memory Unit

Stores data and instructions.

Types:

- RAM
- ROM
- Cache Memory

Output Unit

Displays the processed information.

Examples:

- Monitor
- Printer
- Speaker

